<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Agriculture details crop growth.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Agriculture details crop growth.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on Wednesday detailed the level of crop development to Sunday.</p>
<p>CEREALS  SHOTBLADE  HEADED  DOUGH			  RIPE</p>
<p>Aug 3    1 pct	14 pct  53 pct(soft) 29 pct(firm) 3 pct</p>
<p>92/96    4 pct	55 pct  41 pct			  1 pct</p>
<p>CANOLA   ROSETTE  FLOWERED  PODDED  RIPE</p>
<p>Aug 3    0 pct	 9 pct  85 pct  6 pct</p>
<p>92/96    1 pct	41 pct  57 pct  1 pct</p>
<p>FLAX     TILLERED FLOWERED  BOLL    RIPE</p>
<p>Aug 3    0 pct	20 pct  79 pct  1 pct</p>
<p>92/96    4 pct	58 pct  38 pct  0 pct</p>
<p>FALL CRP HEADED   DOUGH     RIPE</p>
<p>Aug 3    0 pct	11 pct  89 pct</p>
<p>92/96    3 pct	38 pct  59 pct</p>
<p>PULSE CRP VEGETATE FLOWER  PODDED  RIPE Aug 3/97  0 pct	5 pct  76 pct 19 pct</p>
<p>Aug 5/96  1 pct     36 pct  61 pct  2 pct</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
